CONTEXT:  PL/pgSQL function pz_loop(integer) line 6 at RAISE
NOTICE:  noisy 2
CONTEXT:  PL/pgSQL function pz_noisy(integer) line 3 at RAISE
PL/pgSQL function pz_loop(integer) line 6 at RAISE
NOTICE:  i = 2, s = 3, noisy = 4
